From: Wisp buildtools
Subject: [PATCH] Port Rust 1.99.1 to WASIp3 with LLVM 24 and interpreted proc macros

Applies to rust-lang/rust 58cf8f9c35b355199727627d07ae34a4e2846d67.
The macro bridge adapts PR 157709 while retaining the bounded Wasmi 0.40
interpreter, scalar declaration exports and execution receipts.

